@startuml dial-lifecycle
!include visio2003.iuml

title DialDevice - Connection Lifecycle

[*] --> Stopped

Stopped --> Waiting : start() /\nIOHIDManagerCreate, match 045E:091B, register callbacks,\nschedule on main run loop, open seized (shared fallback)

Waiting --> Connected : device matching callback /\nadopt first Dial, emit connected

state Connected {
    [*] --> Configuring
    Configuring --> Ready : send feature report 1\n(detents, auto-trigger)
    Ready --> Ready : input report /\nparse, emit DialEvent
    Ready --> Configuring : first report after >= 15 s silence\nor settings changed
}

Connected --> Waiting : device removal callback /\nreset button state, emit disconnected
Connected --> Recovering : input report error\nor system did wake
Waiting --> Recovering : system did wake
Recovering --> Waiting : after 1 s /\nclose and reopen HID manager

Waiting --> Stopped : stop()
Connected --> Stopped : stop()
Recovering --> Stopped : stop()

@enduml
